Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(branding): white-label payment SDK as HiTechPay

- the "Powered by" footer (HyperSwitchBranding) renders the localised
  poweredBy string with the HiTechPay brand in bold instead of the
  "Powered by Hyperswitch" image from the asset CDN; module name kept
- rewrite user-visible "Hyperswitch" / "HyperSwitch" (and the Arabic /
  Japanese transliterations) to "HiTechPay" in every fetched locale string
  and in the English fallback (poweredBy, mandate texts)
- page titles of the React Native Web entry points -> "HiTechPay Web"
- the Australian BECS mandate (names a legal entity), module / package
  names, native bridge names, JS globals, env variables and the
  `.hyperswitch://` return URL scheme are intentionally unchanged

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014p7hcqtGKsGWvEUtmq6YEC

